{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半部左侧的大号白紫色标题，首先注意到紫色强调的“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”，随后容易看到下方同样醒目的“心慌”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎想回去，却对自己为什么想回去感到犹豫；具体处境第一眼还不够明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、害怕、不敢继续想。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他究竟是舍不得曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是因为害怕孤单，宁愿重新忍受过去受过的气；以及过去经历对这次犹豫的影响。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方两行大标题和下方大标题都很突出。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思：上方标题同时包含想回去、舍不得归属感、害怕孤单和愿意重新忍受委屈几层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里、要拼起来才懂：上方交代犹豫的处境，下方才明确给出心慌的感受及其与这个念头的关系。\",\n    \"小字连续堆叠、要在多条之间挑：中间四行辅助文字信息连续，快速扫视难以提取具体内容。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9adaa337-ff5c-4b33-9c3c-019a4a56aac7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T022947210517Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:30:15.341991+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "243167861abcc293d78599d7d31b4384fdda55b6c2884a179eab17fec87386a1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T022947210517Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1c3728a9f3aefdcbee22fff46d49ba7981f639ca9b511ef6a378a0f9749d9b2b"}}}
